1
00:00:00,192 --> 00:00:02,982
(Sheldon:)...of a specific object or organism.

2
00:00:03,153 --> 00:00:05,193
(Sheldon:)Mimesis.

3
00:00:06,824 --> 00:00:09,074
(Leonard:)What the hell are you talking about?

4
00:00:09,743 --> 00:00:11,703
(Sheldon:)I'm attempting
to communicate with you...

5
00:00:11,870 --> 00:00:15,540
(Sheldon:)...without my meaning becoming
apparent to those around you.

6
00:00:15,708 --> 00:00:16,788
(Sheldon:)Let me try again.

7
00:00:18,210 --> 00:00:23,970
(Sheldon:)Have the indigenous fauna
accepted you as one of their own?

8
00:00:24,758 --> 00:00:27,008
(Sheldon:)Nudge, nudge, wink, wink.

9
00:00:28,012 --> 00:00:29,342
(Leonard:)Oh, I guess so.

10
00:00:29,513 --> 00:00:32,893
(Sheldon:)Good. Oh, FYI,
after I eat my sandwich...

11
00:00:33,058 --> 00:00:35,938
(Sheldon:)...I'm taking Koothrappali's Patang kite
out for a test run.

12
00:00:36,103 --> 00:00:38,693
Would you get your Delta Wing Raptor
and join me?

13
00:00:38,856 --> 00:00:42,356
I don't wanna fly kites, Sheldon.
Come on, we're watching football here.

14
00:00:42,526 --> 00:00:45,696
(Sheldon:)I can see that.
I was providing you with an alternative.

15
00:00:46,572 --> 00:00:51,162
(Sheldon:)A courtesy I was never offered
in similar circumstances.

16
00:00:53,120 --> 00:00:56,160
(Leonard:)Oh, look at that. The Oklahoma coach
has thrown down a red flag...

17
00:00:56,331 --> 00:00:59,041
(Leonard:)...indicating he's challenging
the ruling on the field.

